                el.textContent.includes('Giant pandas were recorded in ancient Chinese literature')) {
        el.textContent = 'Giant pandas have a long history in Chinese culture. In ancient literature, they were called "�?. In "Yi Jing", it describes: "�? like a bear but smaller, black and white, able to eat copper and iron". In "L眉shi Chunqiu", it mentions: "�? black and white, difficult to draw, round, only with a light body". In "Tai Ping Guang Ji", it describes: "�? black and white, difficult to draw, round, only with a light body". In "Ben Cao Gang Mu", it has a more detailed description: "�? like a bear but smaller, black and white, able to eat copper and iron, sharp claws and teeth".';
